# linear-issue/pi/hover 160x45 @44,17 (72x28)
╭─ Linear draft ───────────────────────────────────────────── Close × ─╮
│                                                                      │
│   E  Honor Retry-After when the sync worker backs off after a 429    │
│                                                                      │
│   T  Team      Platform (PLT)                                        │
│   S  Status    Todo                                                  │
│   P  Priority  Medium                                                │
│   L  Labels    Bug                                                   │
│   J  Project   None                                                  │
│                                                                      │
│   The sync worker doubles its delay after every 429 and never reads  │
│   Retry-After, so it retries sooner than the shop API allows and     │
│   gets limited again.                                                │
│                                                                      │
│   • Read Retry-After (seconds or an HTTP date) from the 429 response │
│   • Wait at least that long, then go back to the doubling delay      │
│   • Cap the wait at MAX_DELAY                                        │
│                                                                      │
│   Where: src/sync.sh, src/config.sh                                  │
│                                                                      │
│   Done when: a 429 with Retry-After: 30 makes the worker wait 30     │
│   seconds before its next try.                                       │
│                                                                      │
│   Source: acme/sync-worker · fix/retry-after                         │
│                                                                      │
│   No open issue seems to cover this                                  │
│   Create ↵  Discard [d]  □ Then open in Linear [o]                   │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
